{
  "name": "VendorIQ — Vendor communications & reminders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VendorIQ → n8n\nVendorIQ decides **what** to ask the vendor. This workflow owns **delivery, waiting, chasing and escalation**.\n\n1. Webhook receives the composed email + reminder policy\n2. Gmail sends it; delivery reported back\n3. Wait N minutes → ask VendorIQ \"still waiting?\"\n4. Remind (fresh content each time) until the vendor resubmits\n5. Out of reminders → escalate\n\nThe loop is stateless: every callback response tells the workflow its next step.\n\n**Setup:** connect Gmail on both Gmail nodes and replace `REPLACE_WITH_SHARED_SECRET` (4 places) with the app's `N8N_SHARED_SECRET`.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1d6a8f2-0c11-4a1e-9b7a-000000000001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-120, -420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vendoriq-comms",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1d6a8f2-0c11-4a1e-9b7a-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "6f0f6c3e-5b0e-4a8b-9d55-vendoriqcomms"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-auth",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-vendoriq-secret'] }}",
              "rightValue": "REPLACE_WITH_SHARED_SECRET",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1d6a8f2-0c11-4a1e-9b7a-000000000003",
      "name": "Authorised?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.to }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.body.subject }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "={{ $json.body.html }}",
        "options": { "appendAttribution": false }
      },
      "id": "b1d6a8f2-0c11-4a1e-9b7a-000000000004",
      "name": "Send email (Gmail)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [460, -20],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Webhook').first().json.body.callback_url }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [{ "name": "x-vendoriq-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SHARED_SECRET" }] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ communication_id: $('Webhook').first().json.body.communication_id, event: 'sent', message_id: $json.id }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1d6a8f2-0c11-4a1e-9b7a-000000000005",
      "name": "Report: delivered",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Webhook').first().json.body.callback_url }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [{ "name": "x-vendoriq-secret", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_SHARED_SECRET" }] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ communication_id: $('Webhook').first().json.body.communication_id, event: 'failed', error: $json.error?.message ?? 'Gmail send failed' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1d6a8f2-0c11-4a1e-9b7a-000000000006",
      "name": "Report: send failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-next",
